WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.120 align:start position:19%
Scientists implanted a fake memory into
70% of people. And every single one of

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:12.680 align:start position:19%
them swears it really happened.
In the 1990s, psychologist Elizabeth

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:16.160 align:start position:19%
Loftus ran a now famous experiment. She
told her subjects a completely made up

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:20.240 align:start position:19%
story from their childhood.
Something like getting lost in a

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.240 align:start position:19%
shopping mall. Then she simply kept
asking them about it week after week.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.120 align:start position:19%
Within weeks, a quarter of them
remembered it in vivid detail. The

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:33.040 align:start position:19%
tears, the security guard. None of it
was ever real.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:38.560 align:start position:19%
Here is the dark part. Manipulators do
this every day. Repeat a lie long enough

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:42.760 align:start position:19%
and your brain files it as a memory.
So ask yourself,

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:45.920 align:start position:19%
how many of your memories
are actually real?

